    "notes": [
      {
        "source": "chiuinan",
        "text": "1.崔嵬：极言其高。嵬，音\"危\"，高而不平。"
      },
      {
        "source": "chiuinan",
        "text": "2.窈窕：幽深。"
      },
      {
        "source": "chiuinan",
        "text": "3.牖：音\"有\"，墙侧之窗。"
      }
    ],
